-- the covering hypothesis H_cov: every configuration the chain occupies restricts, on every segment, to
-- one the record holds. It is a property of the record, checkable on it, and not a law of physics: a
-- segment's conformation depends on its context.
HCov : (C : Type 0) → FoldProblem C → Nat → Cover C → Type 0
HCov C F w K = (x : C) → fp-in C F w x → Glued C K x
